# ********************************
# Off-line optimization parameters
# ********************************
# HYBRID DARWIN/DIC-PKG PILOT: small numiter (5) -- mechanical shakeout of
# the surrogate-gradient loop (does M1QN3 accept a (Darwin cost, pkg/dic
# gradient) pair sanely, does the cost trajectory look reasonable) before
# committing to a longer campaign, mirroring hybrid_darwin_bling's own
# 1-month pilot. Fresh-start (optimcycle=0 cold-starts automatically,
# optim_readparms.F:162).
&OPTIM
 optimcycle=2,
 numiter=5,
 nfunc=50,
 dfminFrac = 0.1,
 iprint=10,
 nupdate=8,
/

&M1QN3
/
